@Backend_HostAddress = https://localhost:7117

### Super Admin Login
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@ibms.com",
  "password": "SuperAdmin@123!"
}

### Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Register Company (Tenant Onboarding)
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register-company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Acme Corp",
  "tenantCode": "acme",
  "ownerName": "Alice Acme",
  "email": "alice@acme.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Refresh Token
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Logout Current Session
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Logout All Sessions
POST {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Customers (Protected, Tenant-Scoped)
GET {{Backend_HostAddress}}/api/Customers?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
